    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d477">

                <pb facs="0531" n="451" sameAs="frus:frus1930v01/pg451"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.01/22: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi><anchor
                        n="14" xml:id="d477-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                        calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1930-11-08T23:59:59-05:00"
                        notBefore="1930-11-07T17:00:00-05:00">undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>1. Department’s telegram Nov. 7, 5 p.m., received and deciphered. It is my
                    opinion that the Provisional Government fully controls the country and is
                    supported by the people. Do not see the necessity of postponing recognition
                    until after Nov. 15, since conditions appear to be fulfilled here which
                    justified recognition of present Argentine Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d477-f1" n="14" type="source" xml:id="d477-f1-content">
                <p>This undated telegram was received on November 8, 1930.</p>
            </note>
